Smart Fellas map maker - licences

This project has two parts under two licences.

1. The code: MIT licence
   Every script and shader: the .gd, .gdshader and .gdshaderinc files, plugin.cfg, project.godot,
   the recipes (.json) and maps/bare_sand.tscn.

2. The kit: Smart Fellas map kit licence
   The pieces, textures and pictures:
     addons/smart_fellas_maps/models/
     addons/smart_fellas_maps/textures/
     addons/smart_fellas_maps/thumbs/
     addons/smart_fellas_maps/water/pictures/
   and Godot's .import files beside them.

addons/smart_fellas_maps/water/tony_mc_mapface.bin is by someone else, under its own MIT licence, and
some shaders follow sums from the Bevy engine, under its MIT licence. See CREDITS.txt.


